  "name": "Meridian",
  "description": "A dark, bespoke page for a payments network: tiles that count components by state, the flagship group as a hero card beside the open incidents and maintenance, square bars, and times in UTC with a Local / UTC switch.",
  "modelledOn": "A payments network’s status page",
  "features": [
    "Dark navy page, times in UTC with a Local / UTC switch beside the title",
    "Tiles counting components by state",
    "The flagship group as a hero card under a big “99.99%” headline, beside open incidents, maintenance and the last month",
    "Every other group as its own card with its uptime",
    "Square bars, a three-state legend on top, incidents with an accent rule and chips"
  ],
  "tags": [
    "status",
    "dark",
    "two-column",
    "bespoke"
  ],
